// Static, reviewed inventory of every server/api route file and its expected API-token policy.
// Update BY HAND when a route is added/renamed/removed or the policy changes; never generate at test time.
//  allow  - evaluateApiTokenPolicy must return 'allow'
//  deny   - evaluateApiTokenPolicy must return 'forbidden'
//  mixed  - depends on the :entity value; concrete samples in MIXED_SAMPLES
//  public - bypasses auth in server/middleware/auth.ts (PUBLIC_PATHS, /api/p/, GET /api/settings); asserted against the real
//           middleware without credentials, NOT checked through the token policy (PUT /api/settings is still 'deny')
// Role policy is not covered here (tested separately).
export type RouteAccess = 'allow' | 'deny' | 'mixed' | 'public'

